  "job_B21.3_20251003_114553": {
    "chunk_text": "\u00e6d & scyttisc wex, gesinge maessepreost XII Gif men synd w\u00e6nnas gewunod on \u00fe\u00e6t heafod foran o\u00f0\u00f0e on \u00f0a eagan, wring neo\u00feewearde To monnes st\u00e6mne, nim cyrfillan & wuducyrfillan, biscopwyrt, ontran, grundeswyligean, wyrc to Nim \u00fereo snada buteran, gem\u00e6ngce wi\u00f0 hw\u00e6ten meola, & gesylte, \u00feyge mid \u00f0y dr\u00e6nce, do swa Wi\u00f0 angcbreoste, wyll holenrinde on gate meolce & sup wearm nyhstig. Wi\u00f0 \u00f0one swiman, nim rudan & salfian & finul & eor\u00f0ifig, bettonican & lilian, cnuca ealle \u00feas Wyrc godne drenc wi\u00f0 sidece, wyl betonican & pollegian in aldum wine, do in XXVII piporcorna Wi\u00f0 \u00f0on ylcan, wyll in eala\u00fe \u00fea haran hunan & rudan, geswet mid hunige, syle drincan on mergene Eft, wi\u00f0 sidece, genim hocleaf grene, cnuca swi\u00f0e, m\u00e6nge wi\u00f0 ele \u00fe\u00e6t hit sy swylce clam, cl\u00e6m Wi\u00f0 fotadle, genim betonican, wyl in w\u00e6tere, bewyll \u00feriddan d\u00e6l, syle \u00feonne drincan, & \u00f0a wyrt Wi\u00f0 \u00f0\u00e6re miclan siondan fotadle, \u00fe\u00e6re \u00f0e l\u00e6ceas hata\u00f0 podagre, seo adl bi\u00f0 aswollen & heo sih\u00f0 Wyrc dr\u00e6nc wi\u00fe \u00feon ylcan, genim \u00f0a ylcan grundeswyligean & hindheolo\u00f0an & \u00f0a smalan cli\u00f0wyrt Wi\u00f0 giccendre wombe, wyll pollegian on w\u00e6tere, syle supan swa he hatost m\u00e6ge ar\u00e6f",
